{
    "background_story": "Raphael was a rugged outdoorsman and a star player on his college football team. But few people knew that beneath his tough exterior, he had a secret passion - baking. In his spare time, Raphael loved to whip up sweet treats, and his specialty was the powderpuff pastry. Flaky, light, and oh-so-delicate, his powderpuffs were legendary among his friends and family. After a particularly grueling game, Raphael would often surprise his teammates with a batch of freshly baked powderpuffs, which they devoured in seconds. His love of baking brought a touch of whimsy to his otherwise rough-and-tumble persona, and his powderpuffs became a beloved tradition in the team's locker room.",
